Bootstrap: localimage
From: /vol/projects/BIIM/agentic_immunology/singularity/ciim.sif

%labels
    Author jalil.nourisa@gmail.com
    Description Aging clocks (Python) — ciim + pyaging (BiTAge transcriptomics + OcampoATAC1/2 chromatin)

%post
    set -e
    pip install --no-cache-dir pyaging

%environment
    export LC_ALL=C.UTF-8
    export LANG=C.UTF-8
    export BIOMNI_PATH=/biomni/data
    export PYTHONPATH=/vol/projects/BIIM/agentic_central/agentic/tools/ciim/code:${PYTHONPATH:-}

%runscript
    exec python "$@"

%help
    Aging clocks — Python image.

    Inherits from ciim.sif:
        scanpy, anndata, scikit-learn, scipy, numpy, pandas, seaborn,
        decoupler, celltypist, grnimmuneclock, liana, cellxgene-census, ...

    Adds:
        pyaging — 58-clock compendium (PyTorch-backed, GPU-optional)
            Transcriptomics : BiTAge (bulk RNA-seq, blood/PBMC)
            ATAC-seq        : ocampoatac1, ocampoatac2 (bulk ATAC, peripheral blood)
            + methylation, histone, blood-chemistry clocks (not used by aging_clock_agent)

    Usage:
        singularity exec \
            --bind /vol/projects:/vol/projects \
            agentic_immunology/singularity/aging_clocks_py.sif \
            python3 agentic_immunology/temp/{task}/script.py
